who his wife is.

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:29.280
Surely, you know this man is a threat to our
country and should be impeached for the open

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:30.290
borders alone.

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:34.511
Now, remember, there has been essentially
no change in border policy between Trump and

00:02:34.511 --> 00:02:35.511
Biden.

00:02:35.511 --> 00:02:36.511
