00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:10.010
So this is like it's got to be presented without
comment because there's about a dozen things

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:12.510
in there that don't make any sense.

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:15.540
But this is someone who believes.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:19.730
That they know a lot and that they're really
smart and this is what we're up against.

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:22.750
How do you talk sense into someone like Patrick
or DL?

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:23.750
I don't know.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.090
They signed their email deal.

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:29.330
Even though it came from Patrick, it's very
difficult to do.

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:31.600
Dale wrote in and said, Ouch.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:35.820
David, you just called Native Americans, American
Indians.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:36.820
