00:04:23.089 --> 00:04:25.050
It wasn't a term I came up with.

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:28.520
Dale So see if you can relax a little bit
on that.

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.550
Lisa wrote in about watering times.

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:34.150
