00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:14.779
Men and women.

00:09:14.779 --> 00:09:20.440
If you say Amigas with an A, it's understood
that it's a group of female friends.

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:22.269
This is this is the language.

00:09:22.269 --> 00:09:26.920
This exists in, you know, friendship, that
this is the way it is in Spanish.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:31.759
There's a new thing that has come up, which
is they replace instead of an O or an E. The

00:09:31.759 --> 00:09:32.759
neutral.

00:09:32.759 --> 00:09:35.180
I'm sorry, I just said that wrong.

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:43.720
Instead of an over and a you instead use an
