00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:44.720
me.

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:45.720
Yes.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:49.440
And it is another thing which.

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:55.839
I don't do, and which is similar to Latin
acts that has started to sort of pervade the

00:09:55.839 --> 00:09:56.990
